Description:

imapd implements the OBJECTID+ extension from
draft-ietf-mailmaint-imap-objectid-bis: a compound OBJECTID response
carrying MAILBOXID and ACCOUNTID (and EMAILID/THREADID for messages),
mailbox selection by identifier, an OBJECTID response code on RENAME, and
OBJECTID as a STATUS attribute, FETCH item and LIST return option.  Once a
client has activated the extension, every LIST response it did not ask for,
such as a NOTIFY MailboxName event, carries the mailbox's identifiers too.


Documentation:

docsrc/rfc-support.rst lists the draft.  The draft itself is the reference.


